{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa's Part-Time Job"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Dress Code"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Achievement Test > Achievement Test"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 18}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify ways of improving aspects of the use of expressions, structures and vocabulary according to the learning outcomes of level Elementary A."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le18ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing Uncertainty"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You express uncertainty when you are not sure whether something can happen, or whether something is true or not.<br/> You can use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">Hang on\u2026</span>, or<span class=\"italic\"> I'm not sure</span> to show uncertainty."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I'm not sure about the manager's decision.<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I suppose there are a lot of applicants."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expressions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Hang on...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You need a moment to think about it.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I guess...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You agree with the information.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm not sure...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You don't think you know or agree.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I suppose...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You may know or agree, but are not sure about it.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Formal vs. Casual Clothes"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Certain companies have specific dress codes. In some situations, you must wear formal clothes at all times. <br/> In other situations, you can wear casual clothes on Fridays in North American companies."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here is a list of formal and casual clothes and expressions:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Formal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Casual\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"collared shirt <br/> chef's whites  <br/> business attire  <br/> checkered pants  <br/> tie  <br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"jeans  <br/> casual Friday  <br/> T-shirt  <br/> sport shoes  <br/> shorts  <br/>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "collared shirt"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a formal shirt with a buttoned-up part above the neckline"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to see a picture of you wearing a collared shirt!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about work clothes."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "applicant "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who applies for a job"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I suppose there are many applicants for the job."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "jeans"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a type of informal trousers, usually blue"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can't wear jeans at work! It's formal attire only!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "casual Friday"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in North America, the day when employees can wear informal clothes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can wear jeans on casual Friday."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le18ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "chef's whites"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a chef's formal uniform"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to we